graph TD
    app[Application / ECS Task] -->|1. GetSecretValue| sm[Secrets Manager]
    sm -->|2. Returns current DB Password| app
    app -->|3. Connect with Password| rds[(Amazon RDS)]
    
    subgraph "Automatic Rotation (Every 30 Days)"
        sm -.->|Triggers| lambda[Rotation Lambda Function]
        lambda -.->|Generate & Set new Password| rds
        lambda -.->|Update AWSCURRENT| sm
    end
